BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Hayraiser 5K Fun Run
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T130000
UID:8c2b916653ee1e2c351db3e88a80b18b@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:Fall is in the air! Join us for a fun run through the fields o
 f The Goat Conspiracy Sanctuary. Our second annual HAYRAISER 5k gives you 
 the chance to get out in nature\, meet our amazing goat and chicken reside
 nts\, and help us fundraise for winter. Come out for a fun run/walk or run
  the course twice for a full 5K. The trail is ‘off-road’ through our 4
 6-acre property in Brown County. Check-in and gates open at 9:00 am Race s
 tarts at 10:00 am Includes self-guided visits with the goats and chickens
LOCATION:The Goat Conspiracy\, 6030 E. Kent Rd.\, Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/2026-hayraiser-5k-fun-run-2/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
