DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T160000
UID:033e2316308ae6ebd94a6e25b2cae361@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:Book\, Music\, and Lyrics by Richard O’Brien Directed by Nat
 e Sayatovich Musical Direction by Ray Fellman Choreography by DJ Gray In t
 his cult classic\, sweethearts Brad and Janet\, stuck with a flat tire dur
 ing a storm\, discover the eerie mansion of Dr. Frank-N-Furter. As their i
 nnocence is lost\, Brad and Janet meet a houseful of wild characters\, inc
 luding a rocking biker and a creepy butler. Elaborate dance numbers and ro
 ck songs reveal Frank-N-Furter’s latest creation: a muscular man named 
 “Rocky.”
LOCATION:Ruth N. Halls Theatre\, 275 N Eagleson Ave.\, Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/richard-obriens-the-rocky-horror-show-5/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
