BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CINEkids International Children's Film Series: HOCUS POCUS
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T180000
UID:6c8e2a44f4e8979121df7f9366e3005a@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:You’re in for a devil of a time when three outlandishly wild
  witches—the Sanderson Sisters portrayed by Bette Midler\, Sarah Jessica
  Parker\, and Kathy Najimy—return from 17th-century Salem after they’r
 e accidentally conjured up by some unsuspecting pranksters. The 300-year-o
 ld trio set out to terrorize the town\, but first they must get their act 
 together and outwit three kids and a talking cat! Co-starring Doug Jones\,
  who transforms into the good-natured zombie ex-boyfriend of Winifred Sand
 erson\, William “Billy” Butcherson. [96 min\; comedy\, fantasy\; Engli
 sh]
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East 7th Street \, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/cinekids-international-childrens-film-series-h
 ocus-pocus/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
