BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Michael A. McRobbie's Choice Film Series: KAGEMUSHA
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261025T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261025T210000
UID:1eace7ea6352cf50c7bca55240af63e4@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:Akira Kurosawa’s lauded feudal epic follows the story of a p
 etty thief recruited to impersonate an aging warlord in an effort to keep 
 the warlord safe from attacking competing clans. When the warlord dies\, h
 is general reluctantly empowers the imposter to take over as the ruler to 
 maintain their control. But his commitment to his new role is tested when 
 forced to lead “his” troops into battle. Winner of the 1980 Cannes Fil
 m Festival Palme d’Or\, Kagemusha merges the passion of youthful artisti
 c creation with the genius of a master filmmaker. [162 min\; drama\, war\;
  Japanese with English subtitles]
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street \, Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/michael-a-mcrobbies-choice-film-series-kagemus
 ha/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
