BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Amplify Nashville feat. The Reverend Peyton's Big Damn Band
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261107T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261107T153000
UID:a2fc0dff665e6c4834cfd601bed4a47e@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:A unique community showcase celebrating local and regional tal
 ent rooted in South Central Indiana and the surrounding areas\, Amplify Na
 shville returns to the Brown County Music Center in Nashville\, Ind.\, on 
 Saturday\, November 7\, 2026. Presented by the Brown County Music Associat
 ion\, this evening brings rising artists to the biggest stage in town\, wh
 ere they can share the spotlight with one of the area’s most celebrated 
 nationally touring acts: The Reverend Peyton’s Big Damn Band. The evenin
 g opens with Sami Riggs\, the fan-selected winner of the 2025 Brown County
  Songwriter Showdown. From there\, the spotlight turns to two outstanding 
 bands chosen through the inaugural Rumble on the Rocks competition at Hard
  Truth Distilling on May 30\, June 6\, and June 13. These emerging artists
  will be selected through a combination of fan votes and judges’ scores.
  Headlining the night is Brown County’s own: The Reverend Peyton’s Big
  Damn Band\, often called “the greatest front-porch blues band in the wo
 rld.” Led by master finger-picker Reverend Peyton\, the trio—featuring
  washboard virtuoso Breezy Peyton and drummer Jacob “The Snakob” Powel
 l—has carried their electrifying country-blues sound to 38 countries and
  48 states. With No. 1 records on the Billboard Blues Chart and acclaim fr
 om Rolling Stone and others\, their music is rooted in heart\, tradition\,
  and a live show that leaves audiences clapping\, stomping\, and singing a
 long. At Amplify Nashville\, every ticket helps make a difference. Proceed
 s from the event support Nashville area food pantry Mother’s Cupboard an
 d other Nashville-area charities\, helping strengthen the community that i
 nspires the music.
LOCATION:The Brown County Music Center\, 200 Maple Leaf Boulevard\,  Nashv
 ille\, IN
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/amplify-nashville-feat-the-reverend-peytons-bi
 g-damn-band/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
