BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:What's Happening to Climate Journalism?
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261109T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261109T153000
UID:09297596d669889ee09658aa056a9c36@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:2026 has already proven to be one of the hottest years on reco
 rd\, but it has also seen a decline in news coverage of climate change nat
 ionwide. This panel will examine the dynamics that influence news attentio
 n to climate change and consider the challenges of reporting the beat in a
  contested political and economic environment for climate journalism. Pane
 lists: Ryan Comfort\, The Media School Suzannah Evans Comfort\, The Media 
 School Karl Schneider\, IndyStar
LOCATION:Franklin Hall (IU)\, 601 E Kirkwood Ave.\,  Bloomington\,  IN
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/whats-happening-to-climate-journalism/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
